WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.589
"Zann! Is that really you?"

2
00:00:02.590 --> 00:00:08.563
Zann turned. A teenage girl he'd never seen before was rushing toward him, grinning widely.

3
00:00:08.564 --> 00:00:12.832
"Uh-oh," Perda whispered. "It's another fan!"

4
00:00:12.833 --> 00:00:18.929
"Perda!" the girl exclaimed. She noticed Zann's pet dragon sniffing at a beetle nearby.

5
00:00:18.930 --> 00:00:23.869
"And Zing! Oh wow—it's an honor to meet you all!"

6
00:00:23.870 --> 00:00:29.638
The girl rubbed her hands together. Flowers rained down on the street all around them.

7
00:00:29.639 --> 00:00:35.342
"They're beautiful," Perda said politely, catching one of the blossoms. "Thank you."

8
00:00:35.343 --> 00:00:41.266
The girl beamed. "No, thank you ! You guys saved

9
00:00:41.267 --> 00:00:44.760
Magica!" A few passing pedestrians stopped to see what was going

10
00:00:44.761 --> 00:00:51.948
on. "Look, son," a man told a little boy. "It's Zann and Perda. They're

11
00:00:51.949 --> 00:00:55.339
heroes!" Zann forced a smile as the little boy stared up at

12
00:00:55.340 --> 00:00:59.592
him. It had been less than two days since the grand ceremony celebrating Morb's

13
00:00:59.593 --> 00:01:04.535
defeat. But Zann and his friends were already getting used to attracting attention everywhere they

14
00:01:04.536 --> 00:01:09.334
went. Still, Zann felt a little uncomfortable whenever someone called him a

15
00:01:09.335 --> 00:01:13.005
hero. "We just did what we had to do," he

16
00:01:13.006 --> 00:01:19.325
mumbled. Several people chuckled or clapped their hands to create puffs of colorful magic energy or pretty

17
00:01:19.326 --> 00:01:24.784
sparkles. Zann wondered what his fans would think if they knew he sometimes still thought about Morb's

18
00:01:24.785 --> 00:01:31.438
offer. Zann knew he'd done the right thing by refusing the offer—if he hadn't, Morb would now control

19
00:01:31.439 --> 00:01:36.910
Magica. But Zann still couldn't help wondering . . . Did Morb really know where Zann's parents

20
00:01:36.911 --> 00:01:40.692
were? By now a small crowd had gathered around Zann and

21
00:01:40.693 --> 00:01:44.147
Perda. Thinking about Morb's offer had reminded Zann of today's

22
00:01:44.148 --> 00:01:47.727
errand. "Excuse us," he said. "We have to get

23
00:01:47.728 --> 00:01:51.752
going." "Of course, of course." An older woman beamed at

24
00:01:51.753 --> 00:01:55.994
him. "I'm sure heroes like you have lots of important things to

25
00:01:55.995 --> 00:02:00.777
do." Zann smiled weakly and then hurried off. Perda and Zing

26
00:02:00.778 --> 00:02:04.927
followed. "Slow down!" Perda complained as they raced around a

27
00:02:04.928 --> 00:02:08.967
corner. "Otherwise I'll have to use an Acceleration spell to keep

28
00:02:08.968 --> 00:02:14.293
up!" "Sorry." Zann slowed his pace slightly. "But there's no time to

29
00:02:14.294 --> 00:02:17.901
waste. Who knows how much longer we'll get to stay in First

30
00:02:17.902 --> 00:02:20.064
City?" Perda made a face at the mention of

31
00:02:20.065 --> 00:02:25.471
leaving. "We're lucky the king and queen asked Boz and Gliss' parents to stay for a few

32
00:02:25.472 --> 00:02:30.791
days. Otherwise we'd already be back to our regular lives in boring old Swamp

33
00:02:30.792 --> 00:02:34.457
Bottom." "Yeah." Zann was a little surprised by Perda's

34
00:02:34.458 --> 00:02:39.222
words. Before their adventures had started, Perda seemed content to live in Swamp

35
00:02:39.223 --> 00:02:42.892
Bottom. Zann was the one who had always complained about how boring the town

36
00:02:42.893 --> 00:02:48.815
was. They passed a wall on which someone had scribbled "Voids are Magicians too!" in large

37
00:02:48.816 --> 00:02:54.979
letters. Perda glanced at the graffiti. "Looks like the Void Rights group has been here," she

38
00:02:54.980 --> 00:03:01.518
commented. "At least their messages are polite. Some of the ones from the new anti-Red groups are pretty rude."

39
00:03:01.519 --> 00:03:06.770
Zann nodded, but he wasn't really listening. They'd just reached the university.

40
00:03:06.771 --> 00:03:11.746
"My parents' old lab is this way," he told Perda.

41
00:03:11.747 --> 00:03:14.655
A young woman looked up when they entered the building.

42
00:03:14.656 --> 00:03:17.336
A nameplate on her desk said "Elbi."

43
00:03:17.337 --> 00:03:21.933
"Oh! It's two of the young heroes!" she exclaimed.

44
00:03:21.934 --> 00:03:24.790
Zing spurted out a small blast of flame.

45
00:03:24.791 --> 00:03:30.822
Elbi yanked a potted melody plant out of the way just in time to keep it from getting singed.

46
00:03:30.823 --> 00:03:36.144
"And the dragon." Elbi narrowed her eyes at Zing and frowned.

47
00:03:36.145 --> 00:03:40.595
"Hi," Zann said. "My parents used to run this lab.

48
00:03:40.596 --> 00:03:44.520
Their names are Nax and Asta. Did you know them?"

49
00:03:44.521 --> 00:03:51.721
"Sorry, no." Elbi shrugged. "I've heard of them, of course, but I only started working here two years ago."

50
00:03:51.722 --> 00:03:54.961
"Oh. Well, is Olpa around?"

51
00:03:54.962 --> 00:04:00.643
"No. Olpa and the other senior researchers are all at some big meeting at the palace.

52
00:04:00.644 --> 00:04:04.968
I'm not sure when they'll be back. Should I tell Olpa you were here?"

53
00:04:04.969 --> 00:04:10.358
Zann was disappointed. "Are you sure there's nobody here who knew my parents?"

54
00:04:10.359 --> 00:04:15.616
Elbi looked sympathetic. "Sorry. But listen, I have an idea.

55
00:04:15.617 --> 00:04:19.301
Would you like to see their storage shelf?" She stood up.

56
00:04:19.302 --> 00:04:24.107
"When your parents disappeared, someone put their things there for safekeeping."

57
00:04:24.108 --> 00:04:27.722
"That would be great!" Zann felt a surge of hope.

58
00:04:27.723 --> 00:04:32.056
Could there be clues to his parents' whereabouts on that shelf?

59
00:04:32.057 --> 00:04:34.033
Elbi led the way through the lab.

60
00:04:34.034 --> 00:04:37.553
Being back there after so long felt strange to Zann.

61
00:04:37.554 --> 00:04:43.855
Many things looked the same, but others looked very different. Only a few people were in the main room.

62
00:04:43.856 --> 00:04:47.119
A couple of university students were reading near the bookshelves.

63
00:04:47.120 --> 00:04:49.974
A Void was cleaning a nibbler's cage.

64
00:04:49.975 --> 00:04:54.230
A young researcher was studying a bubbling beaker and scribbling notes.

65
00:04:54.231 --> 00:05:00.140
"Wow, this place is cool!" Perda whispered to Zann, looking around with wide eyes.

66
00:05:00.141 --> 00:05:02.837
"It must be amazing to work here!"

67
00:05:02.838 --> 00:05:06.097
"Yeah, I guess," said Zann, distracted.

68
00:05:06.098 --> 00:05:09.090
He followed Elbi as she opened a closet door.

69
00:05:09.091 --> 00:05:14.941
"It's the middle shelf in the back," Elbi said, rubbing her fingers together to create a light.

70
00:05:14.942 --> 00:05:18.765
As soon as Zann saw the shelf, he was flooded with memories.

71
00:05:18.766 --> 00:05:22.579
There was his mother's favorite hair clip. His father's lab coat.

72
00:05:22.580 --> 00:05:26.819
Even a dragon-shaped paperweight that Zann had given his parents as a gift.

73
00:05:26.820 --> 00:05:30.514
"What's this?" Perda picked up a large metal sculpture.

74
00:05:30.515 --> 00:05:34.694
It was so blackened by fire that the edges were crumbling away.

75
00:05:34.695 --> 00:05:39.289
"I don't know," Zann said. "I've never seen it before."

76
00:05:39.290 --> 00:05:44.477
"It looks kind of like Teplo's pet sniffer goose, doesn't it?" Perda said.

77
00:05:44.478 --> 00:05:49.521
Before Zann could answer, there was an enormous explosion from somewhere in the city.

78
00:05:49.522 --> 00:05:55.291
The building shook, causing some books to fall from the bookshelf. Everyone shouted in surprise.

79
00:05:55.292 --> 00:06:06.941
Zann froze, immediately thinking of Morb and the evil Void's final words: Magica hasn't seen the last of me!

